        "reading_text": "Riverside Reading Group - Meeting Summary\nHeld on 14 March 2027 at the community library, starting 18:30.\nAttendance\nNine members attended: A. Bennett, C. Osei, D. Farrell, H. Nakamura, J. Iyer, L. Moreau, M.\nSantos, P. Whitcombe, and R. Adjei. Two apologies were received.\nDiscussion\nThe group discussed the March title and agreed a mixed reception: six members finished it, and two\nstopped after the first hundred pages. The conversation covered the pacing of the middle chapters\nand the reliability of the narrator.\nThe April title was chosen by ballot. The group will meet on 11 April 2027 at the same venue, and H.\nNakamura will prepare the questions.\nPage 1 of 2",
